                "loc": "LEV.23.26+LEV.23.27+LEV.23.28+LEV.23.29+LEV.23.30+LEV.23.31+LEV.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 23:26–32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.7+NUM.29.8+NUM.29.9+NUM.29.10+NUM.29.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 29:7–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hiri ni lagizo ra kare na kare kpwa enyezi na hata ajeni asagalao kahi zenu. Siku ya kumi ya mwezi wa sabaa, ni mfunge na msihende kazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundahenda hivyo kpwa sababu siku iyo ndiyo siku ambayo mundahenderwa upatanisho, mtakaswe dambi zenu, namwi mundakala swafi mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo ni Siku ya Kuoya kabisa, namwi ni mfunge; hiri ni lagizo ra kare na kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu ariyemwagirwa mafuha na kutengbwa ili agbwire nafwasi ya ise, yani mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, ndiye ndiyehenda upatanisho kpwa kuusa dambi. Naye andavwala nguwo takatifu za katani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ahende upatanisho kpwa kuusa dambi Phatu Phatakatifu Zaidi, hema ra mkpwutano, phatu pha kulavira sadaka, alavyadzi-sadaka na kpwa ajili ya taifa zima ra Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiri ni lagizo ra kare na kare; upatanisho wa kuusa dambi za atu a Iziraeli ni uhendwe mara mwenga chila mwaka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
